# HTML Input Types

Today, I learned about different HTML input types.

## Input Types

* `text`
* `password`
* `email`
* `number`
* `tel`
* `url`
* `radio`
* `checkbox`
* `date`
* `time`
* `datetime-local`
* `month`
* `week`
* `color`
* `range`
* `file`
* `hidden`
* `search`
* `submit`
* `reset`
* `button`
* `image`

## Example

```html
<input type="text">
<input type="email">
<input type="password">
<input type="number">
<input type="radio">
<input type="checkbox">
<input type="date">
<input type="file">
<input type="submit">
```

